  "description": "Official Mistral Cloud API (chat, embeddings, FIM, OCR, files) on the v2 agent model contract (INPUT llm_input → OUTPUT llm_output). Auth is StudioQuack secret api_key sent as Authorization Bearer. reasoning_effort passes through; with reasoning_effort=high the streamed ThinkChunks (nested content lists) are unwrapped onto the thinking channel. PDF/image uploads use type file (platform ref-id). Docs: https://docs.mistral.ai/api. Terms: https://legal.mistral.ai/terms/commercial-terms-of-service. Never log api_key.",
